                    <comments>https://carletonconvos.podbean.com/e/opening-convo-with-raul-raymundo-87-september-15-2025/#comments</comments>        <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 15:40:57 -0500</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">carletonconvos.podbean.com/5b2b31b0-e8da-3c85-ac9c-ee6a8f537389</guid>
                                    <description><![CDATA[<p>The Carleton community gathered in the Chapel on Monday, September 15 at 3 p.m. for Opening Convocation, celebrating the start of a new academic year and recognizing students on the Dean’s List. Opening Convo is the first event in the convocation program and features the Bubble Brigade at the beginning and end, where Carleton seniors blow bubbles from the Chapel balcony over the faculty’s processional and recessional. Read more about the event on <a href='https://www.carleton.edu/news/stories/2025-academic-year-opening-convocation-raul-raymundo/'>Carleton News</a>. </p>
<p>Learn more about Carleton Convos at <a href='https://www.carleton.edu/convocations/'>go.carleton.edu/convocations</a></p>
]]></description>
